{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01UBEM3ErycMwDnz7jv1dXBc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the task carefully:\n\n1. I need to implement pkg/sys file metadata abstraction (prd002-sys R3)\n2. I need to create three files:\n   - pkg/sys/fileinfo.go - Platform-independent FileMetadata type, Stat and Lstat functions\n   - pkg/sys/fileinfo_darwin.go - Darwin-specific stat field extraction\n   - pkg/sys/fileinfo_linux.go - Linux-specific stat field extraction\n\nLet me first read the required reading files that are NOT already provided in the project_context above:\n- docs/specs/product-requirements/prd002-sys.yaml\n\n\n- go.mod\n\nThe ARCHITECTURE.yaml is already provided above. Let me read the PRD and go.mod to understand the project structure and dependencies.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":35625,"cache_read_input_tokens":16066,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":35625},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"000ec219-da40-4bd1-a63a-a0be702f3080","uuid":"1f9e87bd-1427-412b-811c-f1f090897bec"}
